{
  "job_B9.7.4_20251003_115119": {
    "chunk_text": "Gelomen us l\u00e6re\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige gewrit, \u00fe\u00e6t we fleon to \u00fean l\u00e6cedome so\u00f0re Se \u00fee nu hine sylfne to his scrifte wrege\u00f0 for his agene synnen, ne mot hine eft deofol wregen on Jacobus se apostel cw\u00e6\u00f0, andette\u00f0 eower synnen betwux eow, & gebidde eower \u00e6lc for o\u00f0erne, \u00fe\u00e6t & eft se apostel cw\u00e6\u00f0, seo andetnysse \u00fe\u00e6s mu\u00f0es becume\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re sawle to h\u00e6le. & Salomon cw\u00e6\u00f0, synfulle mannen to lare, se \u00fee ahyde\u00f0 his unrihtwisnysse, ne by\u00f0 he gereht beforen Se \u00fee heo geandette\u00f0 & forl\u00e6te\u00f0, sone he begytt Godes mildheortnysse. \u00de\u00e6t is swy\u00f0e mycel h\u00e6le l\u00e6cedom, \u00fe\u00e6t we eft ne gecerren to \u00fean unrihten, \u00fee we \u00e6r geandettan, ne Eac Johannes se godspellere cw\u00e6\u00f0, ondette we ure synnen, for \u00fean \u00fee God is swy\u00f0e getreowe, he us Swa eac se salmscop cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic secge & ic ondette mine Drihtene eall min unriht wi\u00f0 me sylfen, & \u00feu Ondette se synnfulle, \u00fea hwile \u00fee he on \u00feyssen life seo, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he to unrihte dyde, for \u00fean \u00fee mid Ac nu is Gode anf\u00e6nge tid, & nu synden h\u00e6le d\u00e6ges, nu is forgyfonysse tid \u00fean reowsigendan, & So\u00f0lice ealle \u00fea arlease m\u00e6nn habbe\u00f0 swy\u00f0e bitere d\u00e6dbote on \u00fean ecen wite, & heom seo ne Heo mihten heom gebyrgen \u00fea unm\u00e6tnysse \u00fe\u00e6re wite \u00feurh ondetnys",
